  (layer "F.Cu")
  (descr "noknok mezzanine spring pins, interface rev 2 (22 Sep 2026): up to 24x BAT WIRELESS BWCD-L5.5W2.0H3.0 SMD pogo pins (LCSC C2826550; body D2.0 x 4.0 mm, plunger D1.5, free length 5.5 mm, stroke 1.5 mm, 70 gf, 1.5 A, 30 V, 30 mOhm, 10k cycles) in four clusters matching noknok_Mezzanine_4Cluster_Pads. Pad D2.6 with paste. Origin = the mezzanine mounting hole that meets the hub H1: place on the mezzanine TOP at that hole, rotation 0. Populate only the clusters the board uses (A power, D USB, B SPI, C I2C). Board-to-board 4.5 mm (1.0 mm compression) set by M2.5 x 4.5 standoffs; mate the boards straight, guided by the standoffs.")
